---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="連線中斷｜Offline"
  description="請檢查網絡連線，再重新開啟 Anisonary 公開目錄。"
  noIndex
>
  <section class="offline-state page-shell" aria-labelledby="offline-title">
    <div class="offline-state__mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
        <circle cx="25" cy="27" r="17" />
        <circle cx="25" cy="27" r="4" />
        <path d="M35 20c7-4 13-4 18-2v27c-5-2-11-2-18 2V20Z" />
        <path d="m10 52 44-40" class="offline-state__slash" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="offline-state__copy">
      <h1 id="offline-title">目前沒有網絡連線。</h1>
      <p>請檢查網絡連線，再重新開啟頁面。網站會在瀏覽時載入最新內容，不會預先下載整份動畫與歌曲目錄。</p>
      <p lang="en">Check your connection and reopen the page. Catalogue pages load online when you visit them.</p>
      <div class="offline-state__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/">返回首頁</a>
        <a class="button button--outline" href="/search/">重新開啟搜尋</a>
      </div>
      <p class="offline-state__privacy">只預載這個提示頁及共用靜態資產，不保存搜尋字詞、瀏覽路徑、API response 或第三方媒體。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .offline-state {
    align-items: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    min-height: 50vh;
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }

  .offline-state__mark {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .offline-state__mark svg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  .offline-state__mark circle:nth-child(2) { fill: currentColor; stroke: none; }
  .offline-state__slash { stroke: var(--color-ink); stroke-width: 3; }
  .offline-state__copy { max-width: 48rem; }
  .offline-state h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .offline-state p { color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0.8rem 0 0; }
  .offline-state__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .offline-state__privacy { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 1.5rem !important; padding-top: 1rem; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .offline-state { align-items: start; grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; }
    .offline-state__mark { width: 4rem; }
  }
</style>
